e098=\"\">286.4 万</strong><em data-v-ca04e098=\"\">预算内</em></span></div><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-document-grid\"><article data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-card business-form-card\" data-business-target=\"form\"><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-card__header\"><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-tag\">待提交</span><h2 data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同审批单</h2></div><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-document-no\">单据编号：系统自动生成</span></div><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-form\"><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-subject\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同名称 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"subject\" placeholder=\"请输入合同名称\" value=\"123\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-category\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同类型 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><select data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"category\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" disabled=\"\" value=\"\">请选择</option><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" value=\"采购合同\" selected=\"\">采购合同</option><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" value=\"服务合同\">服务合同</option><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" value=\"框架协议\">框架协议</option></select></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-counterparty\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同相对方 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"counterparty\" placeholder=\"请输入合同相对方\" value=\"3333\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-amount\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同金额 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"amount-input\"><b data-v-ca04e098=\"\">¥</b><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"amount\" type=\"number\" placeholder=\"0.00\" value=\"332\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></div></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-date\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">计划签署日期 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"date\" type=\"date\" value=\"\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"wide target-reason\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同事项说明</span><textarea data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"reason\" rows=\"5\" placeholder=\"请输入详细说明\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\">23233</textarea></label></div><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-form-actions\"><button data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-save\" data-action=\"save\" type=\"button\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"> 保存草稿 </button><button data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-dark target-approve\" data-action=\"approve\" type=\"button\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"> 审批通过 </button><button data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-primary target-submit\" data-action=\"submit\" type=\"button\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"> 提交审批 </button></div></article><aside class=\"business-card business-summary\" data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><span class=\"business-tag\" data-v-ca04e098=\"\">流程预览</span><h2 data-v-ca04e098=\"\">单据处理进度</h2><div class=\"business-process\" data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><span class=\"done\" data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">✓</i><b data-v-ca04e098=\"\">申请人填报</b><small data-v-ca04e098=\"\">当前操作</small></span><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">2</i><b data-v-ca04e098=\"\">部门负责人审批</b><small data-v-ca04e098=\"\">等待处理</small></span><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">3</i><b data-v-ca04e098=\"\">业务部门复核</b><small data-v-ca04e098=\"\">等待处理</small></span><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">4</i><b data-v-ca04e098=\"\">归档完成</b><small data-v-ca04e098=\"\">流程结束</small></span></div><div class=\"business-summary__notice\" data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><strong data-v-ca04e098=\"\">操作提示</