e098=\"\">286.4 万</strong><em data-v-ca04e098=\"\">预算内</em></span></div><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-document-grid\"><article data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-card business-form-card\" data-business-target=\"form\"><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-card__header\"><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-tag\">待提交</span><h2 data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同审批单</h2></div><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-document-no\">单据编号：系统自动生成</span></div><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"business-form\"><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-subject\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同名称 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"subject\" placeholder=\"请输入合同名称\" value=\"12312\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-category\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同类型 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><select data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"category\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" disabled=\"\" value=\"\">请选择</option><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" value=\"采购合同\" selected=\"\">采购合同</option><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" value=\"服务合同\">服务合同</option><option data-v-ca04e098=\"\" value=\"框架协议\">框架协议</option></select></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-counterparty\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同相对方 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"counterparty\" placeholder=\"请输入合同相对方\" value=\"12312\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></label><label data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"target-amount\"><span data-v-ca04e098=\"\">合同金额 <i data-v-ca04e098=\"\">*</i></span><div data-v-ca04e098=\"\" class=\"amount-input\"><b data-v-ca04e098=\"\">¥</b><input data-v-ca04e098=\"\" data-business-field=\"amount\" type=\"number\" placeholder=\"0.00\" value=\"12312\" data-sxpt-original-disabled=\"false\" disabled=\"\"></div></l